        "May carries the IB Diploma's main exam session, with results out in early July and a second chance in November for anyone retaking. Cambridge's IGCSE calendar runs May-June and October-November; Edexcel splits between January and May-June. Bihar's own twist sits between these dates: the Ganga swells through the rains, and stretches of Naugachia and Kahalgaon have gone under water in past years, cutting off roads and closing schools for stretches longer than a single day.",
